From 6f77804fab65ed0a05bb71419a86b2f13d60f4e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rafe Walker <45343084+rafe-walker@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:59:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): apply the project test-account default to actors
 queries

The query-* tools drop the generated `filterTestAccounts: false` default
and follow the project's "Filter out internal and test users" setting when
the field is omitted. That only covered a top-level field. The six
query-*-actors tools carry the field on `source`, so they kept the hard
`false` and listed internal users that the insight being drilled into had
excluded.

The factory now strips the default from the actors `source` and applies
the project setting there as well.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
